    faults\u2019, which component, reference or condition mentioned in the authored
    requirement should you inspect first? Explain your reasoning."
  prediction: "For \u2018Diagnose and recover all three sensor-chain faults\u2019,
    what result or observation would you expect if the required setup is correct?
    Distinguish a predicted result from a measured result."
  practice: "In Level 96, perform the objective \u2018Diagnose and recover all three
    sensor-chain faults\u2019 in the actual game laboratory. Compare fresh evidence
    against: Recorded from the electrical graph, valid calibrated feedback and the
    level\u2019s verified run history.\nThe mission evaluator decides completion;
